cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this MCP server, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: OrbitCast MCP Server
abstract: >-
  MCP server that forecasts future Earth-observation acquisitions. It predicts
  when Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, Landsat 8/9 or any user-added satellite will
  image an area, whether ESA's published acquisition plan confirms the image,
  whether an optical image is likely to be cloud-free, when the product can be
  downloaded, and which areas will be imaged in a time window. It uses open
  data only: CelesTrak orbital elements propagated with SGP4, ESA Sentinel-1
  and Sentinel-2 acquisition-plan KML files, and the Open-Meteo cloud-cover
  forecast. No credentials are required.
authors:
  - given-names: Cristopher
    family-names: Castro Traba
    alias: CristopherCastro
keywords:
  - mcp
  - earth-observation
  - acquisition-planning
  - orbit-prediction
  - sentinel-1
  - sentinel-2
  - landsat
  - cloud-forecast
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/eve-esa/mcp-tool-registry/tree/main/servers/orbitcast
